{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3DPlatformerTitle.png?t=1743028917\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/Teaser.gif?t=1743028917\" /><br><br>MOJITO Woody's Rescue puts you on a journey to find your best dog friend Woody, who has been kidnapped by an evil Cucumber, in a cute 3d adventure with sandbox levels, platforming challenges and exploration zones. Inspired by Super Mario 64 - Odyssey / Banjo Kazooie / Celeste<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/MasterBigTitle.png?t=1743028917\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/MasterPlat.gif?t=1743028917\" /><br><br>Combine jump abilities with wall interaction to overcome longer obstacles.<br>With this unique stamina system you will have to master the fast decision making while you perform impossible jumps<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/ExploreTitle.png?t=1743028917\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/TravelWorlds.gif?t=1743028917\" /><br><br>Unlock new balloons and lift your house into the sky to visit strange new worlds<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/BrainTitle.png?t=1743028917\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/PuzzleSample.gif?t=1743028917\" /><br><br>It's not only about action and jumps, you will face multiple mental challenges and puzzles<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse